# Full allow-list for apps/web/Dockerfile's build (context: repository root).
# BuildKit's per-Dockerfile ignore file (`<dockerfile>.dockerignore`, beside
# the Dockerfile) REPLACES the root `.dockerignore` for this build; nothing
# from the root file applies here. This file stands alone.
**
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/
!apps/web/
!apps/web/**
!packages/
!packages/web-contract/
!packages/web-contract/**
!modules/
!modules/*/
!modules/*/web/
!modules/*/web/**

# Re-exclude private artifacts and local dependencies within the allowed
# source trees above. Both the directory entry itself and its contents are
# excluded — `**/node_modules/**` alone still leaves an empty `node_modules`
# directory in the build context, since it excludes the directory's contents
# but not the directory entry that the `!apps/web/**` re-include restores.
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.next
**/.next/**
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc*
**/AGENTS.md
**/AGENTS.override.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.claude/**
**/.codex/**
**/.mcp.json
**/.bureau/**
**/.bureau-worktrees/**
**/.secrets/**
**/.rheo-local/**
**/rheo.local.*
**/*.log
**/.git/**
private/
**/private/**
